<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <%- include('partials/head') %>
  </head>
  <body>
    <%- include('partials/nav') %>
    <main>
      <section class="page-hero">
        <div class="container narrow">
          <p class="eyebrow">Services</p>
          <h1>How we help your business</h1>
          <p class="lead">
            TAIG offers a focused set of services designed to meet you where you are —
            whether you need reliable day-to-day support or strategic guidance for a bigger change.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="service-list">
            <article class="service-card" id="audit">
              <div class="service-card-header"><h2>Audit</h2></div>
              <p>Start with the truth about your systems. We assess your IT, your network, and your day-to-day operations, then show you what is working, what is failing, and what to fix first — in plain language, no jargon wall.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="service-card" id="rebuild">
              <div class="service-card-header"><h2>Rebuild</h2></div>
              <p>Fix it properly, not with a patch that breaks next week. We rebuild what the audit found, document what changed, and hand it back in a state your team can actually maintain.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="service-card" id="monthly-run">
              <div class="service-card-header"><h2>Monthly Run</h2></div>
              <p>Stay fixed. We monitor, maintain, and improve your systems month to month, so small problems get caught before they become outages — and you always know who to call.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="service-card" id="streamwatch">
              <div class="service-card-header"><h2>StreamWatch</h2></div>
              <p>Radio-stream uptime monitoring, checked every minute with real audio verification. When a stream goes down, the outage is logged with a timeline — not a guess.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="service-card" id="home-automation">
              <div class="service-card-header"><h2>Home Automation</h2></div>
              <p>Smart-home setup done properly, prototyped before anything is bought. Low-voltage work only — anything on mains power goes to a licensed electrician partner.</p>
            </article>
          </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section section-alt">
        <div class="container narrow">
          <h2>Not sure where to start?</h2>
          <p>
            Many clients begin with a conversation. Tell us what's on your mind and we'll help
            you identify the right entry point — no obligation, no pressure.
          </p>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Start a Conversation</a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
    <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
